                 &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A       =
                                                         &lt;/li&gt;=0A          =
                                                      &lt;li&gt;=0A              =
                                                      &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run dial=
ogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                 =
               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                    =
            &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                        =
            &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinter=
s.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                             =
       &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                             =
   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                    =
&lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                 =
                               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                    =
                            &lt;li&gt;=0A                                        =
                            &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers folder will o=
pen.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li=
&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;=
Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A                  =
                                                  &lt;/p&gt;=0A                  =
                                              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                     =
                                           &lt;li&gt;=0A                         =
                                           &lt;p&gt;Click the Add Printer button =
and follow the prompts.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;/li&gt;=0A=0A                                             =
               &lt;/ul&gt;=0A                                                    =
    &lt;/div&gt;=0A=0A                                                        &lt;di=
v class=3D&quot;shadow cardbackgroundcolor p-3 my-3 setformac&quot;&gt;=0A              =
                                              &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;mt-2 my-3 text-p=
rimary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                               =
                             &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0&quot;&gt;=0A     =
                                                           &lt;li&gt;=0A         =
                                                           &lt;p&gt;Firstly, you =
will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                                 =
                                       printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                     =
                                           &lt;/li&gt;=0A                        =
                                        &lt;li&gt;=0A                            =
                                        &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printer to the=
 wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                     =
           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                         =
           &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=0A     =
                                                                   driver.&lt;=
/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A =
                                                                   &lt;p&gt;Then,=
 complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                          =
                                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                             =
                                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                 =
                                   &lt;p&gt;After that, go to the Apple Menu.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A=
                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A    =
                                                                &lt;p&gt;In the m=
enu, you have to click the System and Preferences=0A                       =
                                                 option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A            =
                                                    &lt;/li&gt;=0A               =
                                                 &lt;li&gt;=0A                   =
                                                 &lt;p&gt;On the next screen, sel=
ect the Printers and Scanners=0A                                           =
                             option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                =
                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                   =
                             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                       =
                             &lt;p&gt;Thereafter, you need to click the =E2=80=
=9C+=E2=80=9D sign and add the=0A                                          =
